# The one source of packaging/windows/NOTICE, packaging/linux/NOTICE and packaging/macos/NOTICE
# (RB-099-12). scripts/licenses.sh renders it (scripts/lib/licenses_notice.py): a line without a
# tag goes into every file, a line tagged `[windows] ` or `[linux,macos] ` only into those, and a
# `#` line into none. Edit this file, never the three NOTICE files; scripts/tests/licenses-notice.sh
# holds them to it. Paths shared by every platform are written with `/`. @CEF_VERSION@,
# @CEF_COMMIT@ and @CHROMIUM_VERSION@ come from the CEF pin in scripts/lib/tool-versions.sh
# (RB-099-13): render the files again after a CEF update.
rBrowser
Copyright (c) 2026 Alexander Herling / DEGOYA.digital

rBrowser is free software, licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version. See LICENSE. It comes with
ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by applicable law.

This package bundles the following third-party software, each under its own
licence. VERSION.txt names the exact versions. The Rust crates and npm
packages rBrowser is built from are listed with their licences under
Settings > About > Licences; their full licence texts, with the copyright
lines, are in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt beside this file.
[macos]
[macos] The paths below are relative to rBrowser.app/Contents/Resources/; a path
[macos] that starts with Contents/ is relative to rBrowser.app.

Chromium Embedded Framework (CEF)
  https://github.com/chromiumembedded/cef
  Version: CEF @CEF_VERSION@, commit @CEF_COMMIT@, with Chromium @CHROMIUM_VERSION@
  Licence: BSD 3-Clause - the full text is below.
[windows]   Files: libcef.dll, chrome_elf.dll, rbrowser.exe (CEF's sandbox bootstrap,
[windows]   with rBrowser's icon and version information), *.pak, *.bin, icudtl.dat,
[windows]   locales\
[linux]   Files: libcef.so, chrome-sandbox (Chromium's setuid sandbox helper), *.pak,
[linux]   *.bin, icudtl.dat, locales/
[macos]   Files: Contents/Frameworks/Chromium Embedded Framework.framework (its
[macos]   licence also as licenses/cef-license.txt)

Chromium
  https://www.chromium.org
  Licence: BSD 3-Clause (The Chromium Authors) - the full text is below - and
  the licences of the third-party components Chromium contains (among them
  ANGLE, SwiftShader, ICU, V8 and the Vulkan loader), listed in full in
  licenses/chromium-credits.html.
[windows]   Files: part of the CEF runtime above, and d3dcompiler_47.dll,
[windows]   dxcompiler.dll, vk_swiftshader.dll, vulkan-1.dll
[linux]   Files: part of the CEF runtime above, and libvk_swiftshader.so,
[linux]   vk_swiftshader_icd.json, libvulkan.so.1
[macos]   Files: part of the framework above

The source code of the CEF runtime - LGPL components and the written offer
[windows]   The CEF runtime above (libcef.dll) contains components under the GNU Lesser
[linux]   The CEF runtime above (libcef.so) contains components under the GNU Lesser
[macos]   The CEF runtime above (the framework) contains components under the GNU Lesser
  General Public License (LGPL), among them Blink (WebKit) and FFmpeg;
  licenses/chromium-credits.html names each with its licence. rBrowser uses
  the runtime unchanged, as a shared library: you may replace it with one you
  build from the source code below. That source code is the CEF and Chromium
  revisions this package was built from:
    CEF @CEF_VERSION@, commit @CEF_COMMIT@:
      https://github.com/chromiumembedded/cef/tree/@CEF_COMMIT@
    Chromium @CHROMIUM_VERSION@:
      https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/tags/@CHROMIUM_VERSION@
  Written offer: for at least three years after DEGOYA.digital last
  distributes this version of rBrowser - every package, test packages
  included - Alexander Herling / DEGOYA.digital will give anyone who has
  received it, on request, a complete machine-readable copy of the
  corresponding source code of the LGPL components above, on a medium
  customarily used for software interchange or as a download, for a charge
  no more than the cost of making and sending the copy. Write to the address
  in the imprint, https://degoya.digital/impressum, and name the rBrowser
  version (VERSION.txt).

