[windows] Not in this package - downloaded on request:
[windows]
[windows] FFmpeg n9.0.2-39-g7adfbe40dc (the LGPL build of BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds) - the
[windows] video encoder
[windows]   https://ffmpeg.org
[windows]   Licence: GNU Lesser General Public License 3.0 or later (LGPL-3.0-or-later),
[windows]   built without --enable-gpl and --enable-nonfree; its LICENSE.txt is
