[windows]   you run "Video: download ffmpeg", pinned by version and SHA-256, into
[windows]   %LOCALAPPDATA%\rBrowser\tools\ffmpeg\<version>\, and removed with "Video:
[windows]   remove the downloaded ffmpeg". Its source code is offered at the address
[windows]   the download notice names (the source_url of the built-in tool manifest),
[windows]   upstream https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg at commit c179411bbb.
[windows]   Files: none in the package; ffmpeg.exe and LICENSE.txt in the folder above
[windows]
